	"FriendlyName": "CS Character",
	"Description": "Weighty third- and first-person humanoid character: ACharacter subclass with gaits, a first- and third-person camera rig on one key (owner-only head hiding in first person), a frame-rate independent sprint ramp, landing speed cost and slope speed, all driven by one tuning data asset; Enhanced Input bindings, an animation instance that picks locomotion states (idle, walk, jog, sprint, crouch, jump, fall, land) from the movement, a physics-driven body (physical animation sway, stagger on hits, full ragdoll from hits and hard landings, and recovery that blends the settled ragdoll back to the animated pose and stands the capsule up on walkable ground), and feel-testing dev tools (overlay, tuning reload, ragdoll and push keys) behind a tuning flag. Editor module builds a human-range ragdoll physics asset (cones centred and shaped per joint) for a UE5-style humanoid skeleton, speed blend spaces and a locomotion AnimGraph.",
